    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">New Product Introduction (NPI)</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana’s NPI process provides a controlled transition from a qualified design into stable volume production.</p><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Prototype and first-article builds establish the manufacturing process, followed by process qualification and a managed production ramp. The objective is to resolve manufacturing issues and establish repeatability before full-volume production.</p>
