<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:44px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Why run NPI with Hana</h2></div><div class="why-grid"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#155F9B 0%,#0E4A7C 46%,#0A3860 100%);border:none;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark-white.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.24);"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#7EC8FF;margin-bottom:10px;">Production-representative NPI</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Qualify the process that will be used for volume</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.84);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Where applicable, products introduced through Hana’s NPI process move into volume using the same qualified manufacturing process. This reduces process changes between introduction and production and provides a documented basis for transfer between sites where required.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Same process from NPI to volume</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Reduced process change during ramp</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Transferable, documented process</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Traceability from unit one</span></li></ul></div><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#E5EEF5 58%,#D8E6F1 100%);border:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:#BFD4E4;"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:10px;">Process qualification</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Manufacturing capability established before production ramp</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Qualification provides process capability and yield information before full-volume production. Test programs, DFM findings and manufacturing parameters can therefore be established before output increases.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Capability and yield data before ramp</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Test program proven in NPI</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">DFM findings closed out first</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;border-bottom:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">NDA signed before any design is shared</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div>
